
units           metal
neighbor        1.0 bin
dimension       3
boundary        p p p
atom_style      atomic
atom_modify     map yes
newton          on

read_data       silicone_slab.lmpdat
Reading data file ...
  orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (22 19.079963 20)
  1 by 1 by 1 MPI processor grid
  reading atoms ...
  523 atoms
  read_data CPU = 0.041 seconds

pair_style      mliap unified mace_pretained_models/mace-mpa-0-medium.model-mliap_lammps.pt 0
pair_coeff      * * C H O Si

thermo          100
thermo_style    custom step cpu spcpu temp press pe ke etotal vol density fmax fnorm
thermo_modify   flush yes

# Optimized damping parameters for better pressure control
variable        tdamp equal 0.5
variable        pdamp equal 5.0

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Step 1: Quick Minimization
